---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Journal
description: "A quiet collection of things that stay with me: images, words, sounds and links."
---
<section class="hero wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">A personal commonplace book <span>—</span> Cuaderno personal</p>
  <h1>Things that<br><em>stay with me.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-copy">Images, words, sounds and small discoveries, gathered here without hurry.</p>
  <a class="text-link" href="#entries">Wander through the journal <span>↓</span></a>
  <div class="hero-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i></div>
</section>
<section class="entries wrap" id="entries">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The collection</p><p class="count">A few things, kept.</p></div>
  <div class="entry-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
    <article class="entry-card">
      <a class="entry-main" href="{{ post.url | url }}">
        <span class="entry-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.language %} · {{ post.data.language }}{% endif %}</span>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      </a>
      {% if post.data.category %}<span class="entry-category">{{ post.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}
      <a class="entry-arrow" href="{{ post.url | url }}" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">↗</a>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="quiet-note">No rush to catch up. This place grows when it grows.</p>
</section>
